{"seq":16,"slug":"creativity-innovation-thinking","title":"creativity-innovation-thinking","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":6,"docCount":24,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking","rating":{"composite":4.06,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.95,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"创造力与创新思维-简介\">创造力与创新思维 简介</h1><p>本手册面向希望突破惯性思维、在工程实践中释放创造潜能的程序员。软件开发表面上是逻辑与规则的世界，但真正优秀的技术方案——无论是一个精巧的算法、一种全新的架构模式，还是一款改变行业格局的产品——无一不是创造力的产物。遗憾的是，许多工程师在日复一日的需求交付中逐渐丧失了创造性思考的习惯，将自己局限在已知的工具和模式之中。本手册将证明，创造力并非少数人的天赋，而是一套可以系统学习和刻意练习的思维技能。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>创造性思维基础</strong>从认知科学的角度解释创造力的本质，介绍发散思维与收敛思维的互补关系、创造性自信的培养方法以及经典的创造过程模型，为后续章节建立理论根基。第二章<strong>横向思维</strong>引入 Edward de Bono 的系列方法，包括随机输入技术、激发与运动以及六顶思考帽，帮助你在面对技术问题时跳出线性逻辑的束缚，从意想不到的角度找到解决方案。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>工程师的设计思维</strong>将斯坦福 d.school 的设计思维框架适配到工程场景，涵盖共情与定义、构思与原型、测试与迭代以及设计冲刺方法，让你在产品开发中兼顾用户价值与技术可行性。第四章<strong>创新框架</strong>介绍四种强大的结构化创新工具——第一性原理、TRIZ 理论、蓝海战略和颠覆性创新理论——帮助你在技术选型和产品定位中做出突破性决策。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>突破思维定势</strong>直面每个程序员都会遇到的认知固化问题，通过认知灵活性训练、视角转换、约束驱动的创造力和初学者心态四种策略，打破经验带来的思维惰性。第六章<strong>创造性问题解决</strong>将前五章的理念融合为实战能力，包括问题重构、头脑风暴技术、结构化发明方法和创造性协作，让你在团队中成为创新的推动者。</p>\n<p>推荐的学习路径是按章节顺序依次阅读。如果你希望快速上手，可以先从第二章的具体技法开始；如果你面临的主要挑战是在团队中推动创新，建议优先阅读第六章。无论从哪里切入，建议最终完整学习全部六章，因为创造力是一个系统性能力，思维基础、方法工具和实践应用三者缺一不可。</p>\n<p>创造力不是灵感的偶然降临，而是思维习惯的必然结果。让我们开始这段从执行者到创造者的转变之旅。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"creative-thinking-foundations","title":"创造性思维基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-thinking-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-creativity","title":"什么是创造力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-thinking-foundations/what-is-creativity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"divergent-convergent-thinking","title":"发散与收敛思维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-thinking-foundations/divergent-convergent-thinking"},{"seq":3,"slug":"creative-confidence","title":"创造力自信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-thinking-foundations/creative-confidence"},{"seq":4,"slug":"creative-process-models","title":"创造过程模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-thinking-foundations/creative-process-models"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"lateral-thinking","title":"横向思维","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/lateral-thinking","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"edward-de-bono-methods","title":"德波诺方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/lateral-thinking/edward-de-bono-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"random-entry-technique","title":"随机输入技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/lateral-thinking/random-entry-technique"},{"seq":3,"slug":"provocation-and-movement","title":"激发与运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/lateral-thinking/provocation-and-movement"},{"seq":4,"slug":"six-thinking-hats","title":"六顶思考帽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/lateral-thinking/six-thinking-hats"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"design-thinking-for-engineers","title":"工程师的设计思维","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/design-thinking-for-engineers","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"empathize-and-define","title":"共情与定义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/design-thinking-for-engineers/empathize-and-define"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ideate-and-prototype","title":"构思与原型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/design-thinking-for-engineers/ideate-and-prototype"},{"seq":3,"slug":"test-and-iterate","title":"测试与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/design-thinking-for-engineers/test-and-iterate"},{"seq":4,"slug":"design-sprint-method","title":"设计冲刺","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/design-thinking-for-engineers/design-sprint-method"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"innovation-frameworks","title":"创新框架","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/innovation-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"first-principles-innovation","title":"第一性原理创新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/innovation-frameworks/first-principles-innovation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"triz-for-software","title":"软件领域的 TRIZ","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/innovation-frameworks/triz-for-software"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blue-ocean-strategy","title":"蓝海策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/innovation-frameworks/blue-ocean-strategy"},{"seq":4,"slug":"disruptive-innovation-theory","title":"颠覆性创新理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/innovation-frameworks/disruptive-innovation-theory"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"breaking-mental-ruts","title":"突破思维定势","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/breaking-mental-ruts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cognitive-flexibility","title":"认知灵活性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/breaking-mental-ruts/cognitive-flexibility"},{"seq":2,"slug":"perspective-shifting","title":"视角转换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/breaking-mental-ruts/perspective-shifting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constraint-driven-creativity","title":"约束驱动创造力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/breaking-mental-ruts/constraint-driven-creativity"},{"seq":4,"slug":"beginner-mind-practice","title":"初心实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/breaking-mental-ruts/beginner-mind-practice"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"creative-problem-solving","title":"创造性问题解决","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-problem-solving","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"problem-reframing","title":"问题重构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-problem-solving/problem-reframing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"brainstorming-techniques","title":"头脑风暴技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-problem-solving/brainstorming-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"structured-invention","title":"结构化发明","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-problem-solving/structured-invention"},{"seq":4,"slug":"creative-collaboration","title":"创造性协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/creativity-innovation-thinking/creative-problem-solving/creative-collaboration"}]}]}